---
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description={`How ${SITE.name} handles your data.`}
  crumbs={[['Privacy', '/privacy/']]}
>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <h2>What you type into the calculators</h2>
  <p>The numbers you enter stay in your browser. They are not sent to us or stored.</p>
  <h2>Visit counts</h2>
  <p>
    To learn which pages are useful, each page view sends us four things: the page address (for
    example /electricity-rates/ohio/), whether you used a calculator on it, a broad category for how
    you arrived (search engine, AI assistant, social site, another website, a link on this site, or
    directly), and whether the browser is automated. We add these up into daily totals.
  </p>
  <p>
    We do not store your IP address, browser details, the exact page you came from, or anything else
    that could identify you, and we do not use cookies or local storage, so there is nothing to
    consent to and nothing that follows you between visits or sites.
  </p>
  <h2>Advertising and other services</h2>
  <p>
    This site currently has no advertising and no third-party scripts. If that changes, this page
    will say so first. The site is hosted on Cloudflare, which processes requests to deliver the
    pages.
  </p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>
  </p>
</Base>
